5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. It is lovely that we are doing this together. I want us all to feel comfortable and connected in our new space. Shall we start by deciding what information we need?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. To make a fair decision, we should look at the data first. I suggest we examine the sound meter readings and the physio's note from the workstation check.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, I agree with Toshio-san. I think... maybe we should also look at the basis of the department's floor billing? Just to be sure about the costs.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to get this started! I want to make sure our daily flow stays smooth. I'll look into the morning routine on the pilot floor and the arrival times in the badge records!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems we're all very eager. While the ""flow"" is charming, Mio, I'm more interested in the actual physical experience of the desk. I'll take the sound meter readings and the physio's note.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It is wonderful to see everyone's enthusiasm. I think it would be wise to understand the costs of moving our connections. I will look into the facilities quote and the basis of the floor billing.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since Shizue-san and Daisuke-san are covering the billing, I will shift my focus. I'll look into the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year and the drawn plan against the staff survey.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... since Shizue-san is already looking into the billing, maybe I should look at something else too? I'll... I'll check the facilities quote for re-running power and network as well.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, it's okay to double-check! I'm still sticking with the morning routine and badge records. I really want to see how everyone actually starts their day before we move things around!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'm perfectly fine with the overlap. It just means we'll have more people to blame if the budget is a disaster. I'll stick with the sound meter readings and the physio's note.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a good variety of information coming our way. I am happy to help with the financial side of things. Does anyone feel we are missing something important before we proceed?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I think we have covered the basics. However, we should consider the human element. I wonder if we should also look into what this year's two joiners reported to ensure their integration is considered.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, that sounds like a good idea, Toshio-san. I... I think I'll look into that too, and the two project strands within earshot last spring. I want to make sure everyone is okay.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, you're so thoughtful! I'm still super curious about those morning routines and badge records, so I'll stick with those. I think we've got a great list now!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your desire to make everyone ""okay"" is touching, if a bit vague. I'll stick to my choices. Let's get the data so we can stop guessing and actually decide.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a wonderful plan. I will look into the facilities quote and the floor billing. I look forward to seeing what we all discover for the benefit of the team.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will proceed with the unplanned seat shuffles and the drawn plan against the staff survey. Let us see what the data reveals about our actual needs and habits.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and what this year's two joiners reported. I hope the information helps us make a good decision for everyone.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm all set! I'll be checking out the morning routine on the pilot floor and the arrival times in the badge records. I can't wait to see what I find! Let's do this!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Sound meter readings and the physio's note. I'll be the one to tell you if your ""ideal"" layout is actually a nightmare for the back and ears. Let's get to it.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
